    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Radford are delighted to bring to the market this exceptionally well-located detached bungalow, set within a c. 1/2 acre site, in the highly sought-after area of Shielbaggan.\n\nCombining a peaceful rural setting with excellent convenience, this well-proportioned property offers a wonderful opportunity for a new owner to create a home tailored to their own style and taste. With its appealing location, generous accommodation and excellent potential, this property is sure to attract considerable interest.\n\nExtending to approximately 132 sq. m., the home offers well laid out accommodation which briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, dual aspect living room, kitchen/diner, four bedrooms, the master benefitting from an ensuite, and a main bathroom. Externally there is a large detached shed.\n\nIdeally situated just 5km from Ramsgrange, the property enjoys excellent access to a wide range of local amenities including supermarket, pub, a post office, as well as both primary and secondary schools, making this an appealing location for families and those seeking a well connected rural setting.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this property has to offer.\n\nServices: Septic tank, private water, OFCH, alarm."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.3m x 1.8m + 9.7m x 1m\nWith timber flooring, ceiling coving, shelved storage cupboard, radiator covers.\n\nLiving Room - 5.1m x 4m\nTimber flooring, ceiling coving, open fire with feature timber surround & marble hearth, dual aspect windows, double doors to kitchen/diner.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 7.5m x 3.4m\nTiled floor, range of fitted units, breakfast bar, integrated dishwasher & fridge, free standing fridge, hob, oven, extractor fan, microwave. Timber floored dining area with patio doors to rear garden. Ceiling coving throughout.\n\nUtility Room - 2.6m x 2m\nTiled floor, range of fitted units, shelving, washer/dryer, door to rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.2m x 3m\nLaminate flooring, picture windows overlooking front garden, ceiling coving.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 3m\nCarpeted floor, two picture windows overlooking front garden, fitted wardrobes, cornicing.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.4m x 3.4m\nLaminate flooring, cornicing, picture window overlooking rear garden.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4m x 3.8m\nLaminate flooring, extensive range of fitted wardrobes, freestanding wardrobe. Ensuite (3m x 1m); fully tiled suite, step in electric shower, WC, WHB.\n\nBathroom - 3.4m x 2.4m\nFully tiled suite, corner jacuzzi bath, mains power shower, WC, WHB, free standing storage units, wall mounted mirror.\n\n"
      },
